: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 21 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o 10\u00ba Terrugem Trail 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O 10\u00ba Terrugem Trail 2027 realiza-se no domingo, dia 21 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027, com in\u00edcio \u00e0s 09:00 na localidade de Terrugem, no concelho de Sintra, distrito de Lisboa.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as provas e escal\u00f5es confirmados para a edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa integra cinco vertentes oficiais: Trail Ultra, Trail, Trail Sprint, Trail Jovem e Caminhada.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O regulamento oficial e a tabela de pre\u00e7os de 2027 j\u00e1 est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A data oficial (21 de mar\u00e7o de 2027), o hor\u00e1rio (09:00) e as cinco modalidades j\u00e1 est\u00e3o confirmados; o regulamento definitivo, quilometragens exatas e tabela de pre\u00e7os ser\u00e3o publicados aquando da abertura oficial das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es (prazo limite anunciado at\u00e9 16 de mar\u00e7o de 2027).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde decorrem os percursos do Terrugem Trail?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os trilhos desenvolvem-se na envolvente natural da freguesia da Terrugem (Sintra), combinando caminhos rurais, trilhos t\u00e9cnicos e zonas de vale caracter\u00edsticas da regi\u00e3o saloia.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o contacto oficial disponibilizado para informa\u00e7\u00f5es?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Para esclarecimentos diretos sobre a prova, est\u00e1 dispon\u00edvel o contacto telef\u00f3nico 918 419 896 indicado na p\u00e1gina oficial do evento.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"10\u00ba Terrugem Trail 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-03-21\", \"endDate\": \"2027-03-21\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Terrugem, Sintra\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Sintra\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O 10\u00ba Terrugem Trail 2027 realiza-se a 21 de mar\u00e7o na Terrugem, Sintra (Lisboa). Provas de Trail Ultra, Trail, Trail Sprint, Jovem e Caminhada. Consulta aqui!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/terrugem-trail-2026.webp\"], \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/acorrer.pt\/eventos\/4509\/info\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o 10\u00ba Terrugem Trail 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O 10\u00ba Terrugem Trail 2027 realiza-se no domingo, dia 21 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027, com in\u00edcio \u00e0s 09:00 na localidade de Terrugem, no concelho de Sintra, distrito de Lisboa.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as provas e escal\u00f5es confirmados para a edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answe